    "en": [
      "A vintage black-and-white postcard showing a highly ornate, Renaissance-style building with elaborate stucco decoration on its facade. There are multiple arched arcades on the ground floor and numerous shuttered windows above. Several signs in German adorn the building. The bottom left mentions 'ALT GRAZ LUEGG,' and at the bottom right, it is marked 'ERIKA-VERLAG-GRAZ'."
